CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'hists->stats.nr_lost_warned !=
 	    hists->stats.nr_events[PERF_RECORD_LOST]'
#1683: FILE: tools/perf/builtin-top.c:286:
+	if (!top->record_opts.overwrite &&
+	    (hists->stats.nr_lost_warned !=
+	    hists->stats.nr_events[PERF_RECORD_LOST])) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

